{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cyber Courier 2088</strong> is a cyberpunk sci-fi courier game where you can be a <strong>sky taxi</strong> driver transporting passengers and goods in a crazy low-poly world.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278530/extras/ccStorePage_pic1c.jpg?t=1735996622\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start out on foot cleaning up the city, then hover up in a space taxi and\u00a0 <br>enjoy transporting people and goods from place to place some lawful some not so lawful <br>missions.<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278530/extras/cleanUpStrip.png?t=1735996622\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Transport</strong> people and packages within the city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earn Credits</strong> and buy weapons and items.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Navigate</strong> Sky Highways (in the full game)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tow</strong> Stranded Vehicles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Clean</strong>\u00a0up the City</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Avoid</strong> local authorities\u00a0<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278530/extras/TowingStrip.png?t=1735996622\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The Demo is limited to one City.<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278530/extras/asteroidStrip.png?t=1735996622\" />The <strong>Demo</strong> is in a early <strong>alpha</strong> state.<br><br><strong>Latest Updates:</strong><br>Hoverboard - Test it now !!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to make suggestions at this phase?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278530/extras/cyberCourierCat.png?t=1735996622\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then <strong>join</strong> our <strong>Discord</strong> =&gt; See <strong>Steam Links <br> </strong>Weather you call it a\u00a0Cyberpunk \u00a0CyberCab, CyberTaxi, Cyber Courier game...<br>be the ultimate transporter in the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3278530?t=1735996622","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3278530?t=1735996622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278530/3d48512ac32f1fbe4572434e02724ab30b37210e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1735996622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278530/3d48512ac32f1fbe4572434e02724ab30b37210e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1735996622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cyber Courier 2088</strong> is a cyberpunk sci-fi courier game where you can be a <strong>sky taxi</strong> driver transporting passengers and goods in a crazy low-poly world.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278530/extras/ccStorePage_pic1c.jpg?t=1735996622\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start out on foot cleaning up the city, then hover up in a space taxi and\u00a0 <br>enjoy transporting people and goods from place to place some lawful some not so lawful <br>missions.<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278530/extras/cleanUpStrip.png?t=1735996622\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><stron